### Test API is working
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/test

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrPhone": "faysal@mobile.com",
  "password": "your-password"
}

### Test with token (replace YOUR_TOKEN with the actual token from login response)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/test-auth
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

### Get current user
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

### Test groups endpoint
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/groups
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
